  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">你喜歡玩殭屍末日遊戲嗎？當你試圖在一群變異殭屍中生存時，會發生什麼事？你活得越久，它們就越強大！這個模組包就是為了這種生存體驗而設計的。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">特色：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 每晚都會發生血月事件。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 在火車上生存。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 抵禦成群殭屍及其變種的攻擊。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">- 新增槍械、武器、工具，讓生存體驗更完善。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">此模組包專為自訂地圖製作，可在樂祈喵愛發電下載：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.net%252fa%252fleqimiao\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://afdian.net/a/leqimiao</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">不過，即使沒有自訂地圖也可以使用！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">也可以在嗶哩嗶哩上找到關於火車主題的影片。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">你可以在嗶哩嗶哩上找到我的影片。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fb23.tv%252fv2vy9iS\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://b23.tv/v2vy9iS</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">注意：英文翻譯純粹是機器翻譯。Optifine 需要手動下載。下載後，只需將 .jar 檔案複製到此特定實例的 Mods 資料夾中即可。</span></p>",
